1
00:00:00,608 --> 00:00:02,494
As Uke comes to grab your shoulder

2
00:00:02,795 --> 00:00:05,297
slide back using your opposite arm

3
00:00:05,298 --> 00:00:08,971
putting in front of his face to distract him 
and to control the space

4
00:00:09,272 --> 00:00:10,912
cut down to his wrist

5
00:00:10,913 --> 00:00:14,994
keeping his wrist on your shoulder 
turn your hips and step forward

6
00:00:14,995 --> 00:00:16,995
as you do so step in deeply

7
00:00:17,396 --> 00:00:18,220
cut down

8
00:00:18,221 --> 00:00:20,280
bring Uke´s shoulder down in front of you,

9
00:00:20,581 --> 00:00:22,067
come around to the front,

10
00:00:22,068 --> 00:00:24,049
keeping his shoulder in between your knees

11
00:00:25,450 --> 00:00:28,792
as you do so, bring his arm around
controlling his wrist

12
00:00:28,793 --> 00:00:30,477
hold it close towards your body

13
00:00:30,778 --> 00:00:33,492
turn the whole body towards his head 
for the pin.

